<div class="mobile-panel" id="mobile-menu">
  <ul>
    <li><a class="mobile-link" href="index.html">Overview</a></li>
    <li><a class="mobile-link" href="our-work.html">Our Work</a></li>
    <li><a class="mobile-link" href="gallery.html">Gallery</a></li>
    <li><a class="mobile-link" href="our-story.html">Our Story</a></li>
    <li><a class="mobile-link" href="financial-education.html">Financial Education</a></li>
    <li><a class="mobile-link" href="contact.html" aria-current="page">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a class="btn btn-gold" href="donate.html">Donate</a>
  <p class="mobile-note">Empowering children through financial education.</p>
</div>

<main id="main" class="page-main">

  <!-- ============ PAGE HERO ============ -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Overview</a> <span class="sep">◆</span> Contact</p>
      <span class="eyebrow">Say hello</span>
      <h1>Let's Build Better Financial Futures Together.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Questions, ideas, collaborations or simply a hello — we would love to hear from you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ FORM + INFO ============ -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split top">

      <div class="form-card reveal">
        <!-- Form backend — Formspree (free plan, 50 submissions/month)
             Replace the action URL with your own once you sign up. -->
        <form id="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xaeqyzdj" method="POST" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cf-name">Name *</label>
              <input id="cf-name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your full name" autocomplete="name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cf-email">Email *</label>
              <input id="cf-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cf-phone">Phone (optional)</label>
              <input id="cf-phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Your phone number" autocomplete="tel">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cf-org">Organization (optional)</label>
              <input id="cf-org" name="organization" type="text" placeholder="School, NGO or company">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="cf-message">Message *</label>
            <textarea id="cf-message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us how you would like to support Project Gullak…" required></textarea>
          </div>

          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send Message
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </button>

          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cf-name">Name</label>
              <input id="cf-name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your full name" autocomplete="name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cf-email">Email</label>
              <input id="cf-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cf-phone">Phone <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
              <input id="cf-phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Your phone number" autocomplete="tel">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cf-org">Organization <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
              <input id="cf-org" name="organization" type="text" placeholder="School, NGO or company">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="cf-message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="cf-message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us how you would like to support Project Gullak…" required></textarea>
          </div>

          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send Message
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </button>

          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" style="--delay:.1s">
        <span class="eyebrow">Reach us directly</span>
        <h2>Contact Information</h2>
        <p>Prefer to reach out yourself? Use the details below. <em>All fields are editable placeholders — replace them with your real contact information.</em></p>

        <ul class="contact-info">
          <li>
            <span class="ci-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5.5" width="18" height="13" rx="2.5"/><path d="m4.6 8 7.4 5 7.4-5"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="ci-label">Email</span>
              <span class="ci-value ph">[Email Address]</span>
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ci-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.6 3.5h3l1.5 4-2 1.5a11.2 11.2 0 0 0 4.9 4.9l1.5-2 4 1.5v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2A16.6 16.6 0 0 1 4.6 5.7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2.2z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="ci-label">Phone</span>
              <span class="ci-value ph">[Phone Number]</span>
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ci-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-5.6 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 5.4 7 11 7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.6"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="ci-label">Location</span>
              <span class="ci-value ph">[Location]</span>
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ci-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="2.6"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="2.6"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="17.5" r="2.6"/><path d="m8.4 10.8 6.8-3.2M8.4 13.2l6.8 3.2"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="ci-label">Social Media</span>
              <span class="ci-value ph">[Social Media Links]</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <!-- SOCIAL ICONS — replace href="#" with the profile URLs -->
        <div class="social-row">
          <a class="social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/projectgullak_" aria-label="Instagram">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.2" y="3.2" width="17.6" height="17.6" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.1" cy="6.9" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/projectgullak_" aria-label="Facebook">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.4 21v-7.2h2.4l.4-3h-2.8V9c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.3V4.8c-.3 0-1.1-.1-2.1-.1-2.1 0-3.6 1.3-3.6 3.7v2.4H8v3h2.6V21z"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/projectgullak_" aria-label="YouTube">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.6" y="5.6" width="18.8" height="12.8" rx="4"/><path d="M10.6 9.6 15.4 12l-4.8 2.4z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/projectgullak_" aria-label="LinkedIn">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.2" y="3.2" width="17.6" height="17.6" rx="3.2"/><path d="M7.6 10.6v6M7.6 7.6v.02M11.6 16.6v-6M11.6 13c0-1.4 2.6 1.9 2.6 3.6v3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow center">One more way</span>
      <h2>Prefer to give directly?</h2>
      <p>Donations can be made quickly by scanning the UPI QR code on our donate page.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="donate.html">Donate</a>
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="our-work.html">Explore Our Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="Project Gullak — home">
          <img class="brand-mark" src="assets/img/project-gullak-logo.jpeg" alt="Project Gullak logo">
          <span class="brand-name">Project <em>Gullak</em></span>
        </a>
        <p class="footer-desc">Empowering children through financial education.</p>
        <p class="footer-text">A nonprofit initiative making financial education simple, practical and accessible — so every child can learn to save, plan and spend wisely.</p>
        <!-- SOCIAL LINKS — replace href="#" with the organisation's profile URLs -->
        <div class="social-row">
          <a class="social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/projectgullak_" aria-label="Instagram">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.2" y="3.2" width="17.6" height="17.6" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.1" cy="6.9" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/projectgullak_" aria-label="Facebook">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.4 21v-7.2h2.4l.4-3h-2.8V9c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.3V4.8c-.3 0-1.1-.1-2.1-.1-2.1 0-3.6 1.3-3.6 3.7v2.4H8v3h2.6V21z"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/projectgullak_" aria-label="YouTube">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.6" y="5.6" width="18.8" height="12.8" rx="4"/><path d="M10.6 9.6 15.4 12l-4.8 2.4z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/projectgullak_" aria-label="LinkedIn">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.2" y="3.2" width="17.6" height="17.6" rx="3.2"/><path d="M7.6 10.6v6M7.6 7.6v.02M11.6 16.6v-6M11.6 13c0-1.4 2.6 1.9 2.6 3.6v3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Explore</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="index.html">Overview</a></li>
          <li><a href="our-work.html">Our Work</a></li>
